# Android signing keys never live in the repository (AB#4723, docs/ANDROID.md)
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pk8

# Release hygiene (AB#4738), checked by scripts/repo-hygiene.test.mjs. Build output: dist and apps/web/dist-qa above.
# The Android build's own output, and the version file scripts/version.mjs writes on every build (AB#4732).
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/version.properties
# Google service-account credentials (a Play Console publishing key is one). The test also refuses any tracked JSON
# with a service account's shape, whatever it is called.
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
